951
01:18:48,236 --> 01:19:02,627
[SPEAKER_19]: So it says, dear Chair Doherty and Zoning Board of Appeals, I write in favor of the RISE development located at 4060 Mystic Valley Parkway being proposed on Mystic Valley Parkway and the zoning relief they are requesting.

