1420
02:07:30,641 --> 02:07:39,647
[SPEAKER_19]: Its shape, its size, the wetlands element, you know, it's de minimis, the violation.

1421
02:07:39,687 --> 02:07:45,751
[SPEAKER_19]: And I know in the, I don't think it was said out loud today, but in some of the materials in the application,

1422
02:07:46,974 --> 02:07:53,456
