1424
02:07:57,358 --> 02:08:00,779
[SPEAKER_19]: So yeah, on the balance, kind of those are my thoughts.

1425
02:08:01,479 --> 02:08:04,880
[SPEAKER_19]: Like I said, not thrilled about the height one.

1426
02:08:04,940 --> 02:08:10,302
[SPEAKER_19]: I think there's probably a better path for that, but I do think there's a case either way.

1427
02:08:13,463 --> 02:08:15,704
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, and you know, Mike, I appreciate

1428
02:08:16,877 --> 02:08:19,058
