1431
02:08:35,446 --> 02:08:43,710
[SPEAKER_04]: And my question is always, even if you have the unique condition that creates the hardship, how do you get to this?

1432
02:08:44,349 --> 02:08:48,412
[SPEAKER_04]: size, this volume, how do we get from two stories to justifying eight?

