[SPEAKER_17]: Thank you, Madam Chair, members of the board, really appreciate your time and your diligence on this project tonight.

1621
02:22:21,016 --> 02:22:22,697
[SPEAKER_17]: I know it's almost 10 o'clock.

1622
02:22:22,797 --> 02:22:24,817
[SPEAKER_17]: So I really appreciate it.

1623
02:22:24,877 --> 02:22:32,419
[SPEAKER_17]: All of us in the project team are excited to bring this project to life in Medford and hoping that we can share updates with you as we move along.

1624
02:22:32,559 --> 02:22:33,299
[SPEAKER_17]: So thank you so much.

1625
02:22:33,619 --> 02:22:34,999
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, we're really excited to how it goes.

1626
02:22:35,739 --> 02:22:42,921
[SPEAKER_04]: And I can't say this enough times, we just really appreciate the community engagement that you folks have had on this and the thoughtfulness that you brought to the project.

1627
02:22:44,472 --> 02:22:46,034
[SPEAKER_17]: We'll continue to do that, Madam Chair.

1628
02:22:46,074 --> 02:22:46,714
[SPEAKER_17]: Thank you so much.

1629
02:22:47,055 --> 02:22:47,675
[SPEAKER_04]: Yep, you're welcome.

1630
02:22:47,695 --> 02:22:48,636
[SPEAKER_04]: All right, good luck, everyone.

1631
02:22:49,237 --> 02:22:49,918
[SPEAKER_05]: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1632
02:22:49,958 --> 02:22:50,418
[SPEAKER_05]: Thank you, board.

