1636
02:23:03,351 --> 02:23:03,851
[SPEAKER_21]: Absolutely.

1637
02:23:04,211 --> 02:23:06,173
[SPEAKER_04]: Whenever we vote in your favor, we ask for that.

1638
02:23:06,213 --> 02:23:07,815
[SPEAKER_04]: It makes our lives just a little bit easier.

1639
02:23:08,562 --> 02:23:08,982
[SPEAKER_07]: My pleasure.

1640
02:23:09,323 --> 02:23:10,283
[SPEAKER_03]: Okay, thank you so much.

1641
