[SPEAKER_03]: Chris, can I just, before you, actually, before you jump off of that, what is your plan for filing the written decision?

1642
02:23:15,287 --> 02:23:19,050
[SPEAKER_03]: Because this one does have a somewhat tight turnout.

1643
02:23:19,070 --> 02:23:22,312
[SPEAKER_03]: Will you be reviewing it at another meeting or do you just review it and file it?

1644
02:23:23,873 --> 02:23:26,315
[SPEAKER_04]: No, they just send us a draft and then we draft it up.

1645
02:23:26,675 --> 02:23:30,758
[SPEAKER_04]: We review it internally and sign it the way that we do all of our other decisions.

