[SPEAKER_05]: depending on the week.

1718
02:26:54,658 --> 02:26:55,779
[SPEAKER_05]: So, but I can make it work.

1719
02:26:56,239 --> 02:26:56,880
[SPEAKER_05]: We'll figure it out.

1720
02:26:56,960 --> 02:26:58,501
[SPEAKER_05]: So, but- Yeah, we'll get it worked out.

