1756
02:29:06,356 --> 02:29:07,357
[SPEAKER_19]: So I just want to make sure we.

1757
02:29:08,124 --> 02:29:10,827
[SPEAKER_19]: we've burned through the agenda before someone motions to adjourn.

1758
