1761
02:29:32,122 --> 02:29:38,406
[SPEAKER_10]: And the applicant Mill Creek is working on finalizing their amended application.

1762
02:29:38,426 --> 02:29:42,188
[SPEAKER_10]: I spoke with the representative Tim Alexander.

1763
02:29:43,229 --> 02:29:56,292
[SPEAKER_10]: earlier this week and he thinks they can they will be submitting that to the city by the end of July and then there's a 30-day turnaround for the board.

