[SPEAKER_19]: Yeah, especially seven people who need a training, too.

1771
02:30:28,394 --> 02:30:29,414
[SPEAKER_19]: So that's even better.

1772
02:30:29,454 --> 02:30:31,275
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, seven people who love to see training.

1773
02:30:32,873 --> 02:30:35,075
[SPEAKER_19]: Not just figuring it out as you go.

1774
