[SPEAKER_04]: And I get into these meetings every time.

1775
02:30:36,776 --> 02:30:42,061
[SPEAKER_04]: And there's something procedural that I forget every single time, but we're doing our best.

1776
02:30:42,081 --> 02:30:43,562
[SPEAKER_19]: Just one clarifying question.

1777
02:30:43,622 --> 02:30:45,023
[SPEAKER_19]: So I mentally prepare myself.

1778
02:30:45,103 --> 02:30:54,291
